#: {{syn|en|invent|originate|mint}}
#: {{ux|en|Over the last century the advance in science has led to many new words being '''coined'''.}}
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Coriolanus|page=15|act=III|scene=i|passage=Not fearing outward force: So ſhall my Lungs / '''Coine''' words till their decay, againſt thoſe Meazels}}
#* {{RQ:Dryden Virgil|Aeneis|1|passage=Some tale, some new pretense, he daily '''coined''', / To soothe his sister and delude her mind.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2010-08-30|author=Charlie Brooker|title=Buzzwords for blowhards|journal=w:The Guardian|url=https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2010/aug/30/charlie-brooker-buzzwords-blowhards|volume=|issue=|page=|text=Because in today's 2,000mph technological freefall, he who '''coins''' the catchiest buzzword generally wins the debate by default.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20230530083120/https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2010/aug/30/charlie-brooker-buzzwords-blowhards}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Kim Elsesser|title=Mankeeping: How Shrinking Male Social Networks May Burden Women|magazine=w:Forbes|url=https://www.forbes.com/sites/kimelsesser/2024/10/23/mankeeping--how-shrinking-male-social-networks-may-burden-women/|date=2024-10-23|passage=As a result, men turn to the women in their lives to fulfill their emotional needs. Ferrara and her coauthor are not the first to suggest that women bear the burden of mankeeping (although they did '''coin''' the term).|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20250317180806/https://www.forbes.com/sites/kimelsesser/2024/10/23/mankeeping--how-shrinking-male-social-networks-may-burden-women/}}
#* {{quote-web|en|title=Chenab Valley United|url=https://preciouskashmir.com/2025/07/24/chenab-valley-united/|work=Precious Kashmir|date=2025-07-24|author=Mubasher Sharief Pathan|passage=According to Collins Dictionary and Wiktionary, the term was '''coined''' in 2017 by journalist Anzer Ayoob, the term Chenabi is derived from the Chenab River, with the suffix “-i”, commonly used to denote belonging.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20250829201354/https://preciouskashmir.com/2025/07/24/chenab-valley-united/}}
