#* {{RQ:Locke Value|page=36|passage=[...] Tenants cannot '''coin''' their Rent juſt at Quarter-day, but muſt gather it up by degrees, and lodge it with them till Pay-day, or borrow it of thoſe who have it lying by them, [...]}}

