===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|comete}}, partly from {{inh|en|ang|comēta}} and partly from {{der|en|fro|comete}}, both from {{der|en|la|comētēs}}, from {{der|en|grc|κομήτης|t=longhaired}}, short for ἀστὴρ κομήτης ([astēr] komētēs, "longhaired [star])" and referring to the tail of a comet, from {{m|grc|κόμη|t=hair}}. Compare {{noncog|en|faxed star}} and {{noncog|la|crīnīta stēlla||comet|lit=(long) haired star}}.

===Pronunciation===
